questions.question:
以下代码的输出结果是？
```c
int a = 5;
double b = a / 2;
printf("%.1f", b);
```

questions.code:
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
    int a = 5;
    double b = a / 2;
    printf("%.1f", b);  // 输出 2.0

    double c = a / 2.0;
    printf("%.1f", c);  // 输出 2.5
    return 0;
}

